    \end{align*}
    Since average $=$ total $/$ count, we have
    \begin{align*}
    \text{Jenny's average} &= \frac{\text{Jenny's total}}{4} = \frac{352}{4} = 88
    \end{align*}
    Thus the difference between the average scores is
